WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.770
How big is Dhaka?

2
00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:05.370
The 2022 census counted
about 10.3 million,

3
00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.110
in two city corporations.

4
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:14.630
The UN's 2025 method says 36.6
million, second only to Jakarta.

5
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.950
Same place, different boundaries.

6
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.170
Hold the UN's 2018 definitions steady,
and 19.6 million in 2018 would be about

7
00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:26.270
25 million by 2025.

8
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:30.070
As Dhaka grows, who gains, and who pays?

9
00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:33.030
Does everyone win, or everyone lose?

10
00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.410
In this mission, you'll trace
why people move to Dhaka,

11
00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:39.170
from rural push to urban pull.

12
00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.790
Then you'll sort the
consequences by who is affected,

13
00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:45.030
and judge the city's management responses.

14
00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:49.710
Your mission: decide who gains
and who loses as Dhaka grows.
